10
00:53:02,608 --> 00:53:08,608
Star Trek Beyond is a 2016 American science fiction action film directed
by Justin Lin, and written by Simon Pegg and Doug Jung.

11
00:58:20,869 --> 00:58:26,869
It is the 13th film in the Star Trek franchise and the third installment in the reboot
series, following Star Trek (2009) and Star Trek Into Darkness (2013).

12
01:03:39,130 --> 01:03:45,130
Chris Pine and Zachary Quinto reprise their respective roles as Captain James T.

13
01:08:57,391 --> 01:09:03,391
Kirk and Commander Spock, with Pegg, Karl Urban, Zoe Saldaña, John Cho, and
Anton Yelchin reprising their roles from the previous films.

14
01:14:15,652 --> 01:14:21,652
Idris Elba, Sofia Boutella, Joe Taslim, and Lydia Wilson also appear.

15
01:19:33,913 --> 01:19:39,913
Principal photography began in Vancouver on June 25, 2015.

16
01:24:52,173 --> 01:24:58,173
Two weeks after its Sydney premiere, it was released in the United
States on July 22, 2016, by Paramount Pictures.

17
01:30:10,434 --> 01:30:16,434
The film is dedicated to the memory of Yelchin and actor Leonard
Nimoy, who both died before the film was released.

18
01:35:28,695 --> 01:35:34,695
The film grossed $343.5 million at the box office, and
received positive reviews from critics.

19
01:40:46,956 --> 01:40:52,956
At the 89th Academy Awards, the film was nominated
for Best Makeup and Hairstyling.

20
01:46:05,217 --> 01:46:11,217
A sequel entered development but was ultimately canceled.

21
